  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Is ar éigean atá spás d'aon scannán amháin anseo. Plugáil diosca USB isteach sa bhosca — formáidithe mar FAT32, rud a ghlacann gach bosca Android leis — agus taispeánfar thuas é chun íoslódáil air ina áit.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Níl aon chuntas ann le sínigh isteach ann agus ní shioncronaítear aon rud le freastalaí. Stóráiltear an méid a bhreathnaíonn tú air, cé chomh fada is a chuaigh tú, do cheanáin agus do liosta faire go léir ar an ngléas seo agus ní fhágann siad é riamh. Tá sioncronú idir scáileáin beartaithe; go dtí sin, is é an cúltaca thíos an bealach a bhogann leabharlann.",
